      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Childhood asthma has an adverse impact on children, families, and society. Treatment of asthma presents special challenges related to diagnosis, ongoing symptom monitoring, and treatment when the patient is a child. To be effective, treatment needs to be medically sound and developmentally appropriate."},
